    <Notes ShowOnLoad="0" Notes="TCE1:TCE-SC-20261014-F1&#10;Hardware: JPT YDFLP-E-60-M7-M-R 60 W, serial MC2BDJD71684; lens: F-Theta 174 mm; material: titanium (link the exact grade and batch in the experiment record).&#10;Repetition-rate response test for JPT YDFLP-E-60-M7-M-R with F-Theta 174 mm. Each row is one 56 mm LightBurn Line stroke, frequencies 1/5/10/20/30/40/48/60/80/100/150/200/300/500/800/1200/2000/4000 kHz. Fixed P20%, V2000 mm/s and the 2 ns pulse step; one pass. This spans the laser passport's stated 1-4000 kHz repetition range. Frequency also changes pulse energy and output response, so compare track continuity and width as a response curve; this is not a frequency-only power measurement.&#10;Canvas 76 x 56 mm; registered bounds 98 x 93.5 mm. First: full-area cross-hatched cleaning, 20% / 48 kHz / 2000 mm/s / 200 ns / 0.05 mm; second: black marker/label layer 25% / 60 kHz / 150 mm/s / 200 ns / 0.01 mm, one pass."/>
</LightBurnProject>
